        "url": "https://github.com/tsaanghwang/Yime/pull/113#discussion_r4489774161",
        "body": "The ARM64 broker built here cannot run: `cmd/yimebroker-18u/main.go` rejects every GOARCH other than `amd64`, and its native gate is also x64-only. Consequently the newly enabled ARM64 installed-host check fails while waiting for `READY yimebroker-18u`. Please port the broker's native gate and resource contract too: `touchbroker.NewProduction` still reads `18u-touch-product.json` and requires `scope.architecture == \"x64\"`, whereas this package ships only the ARM64 descriptor. Add a regression exercising that production initialization, not just mocked children."
      }
    ],
    "sourceAssessment": "Original x64-only entry/native/resource issue is already fixed by ac326cba. Existing constructor/first-open coverage is preserved. Thread resolution remains outstanding.",
